@item @code{speech_set} @tab audio @tab irreversible @tab the previous speech setting is not kept
@item @code{split_window} @tab window @tab inverse @tab Put the window layout back, unless it was changed again since.
@item @code{switch_to_buffer} @tab buffer @tab inverse @tab Put the window layout back, and kill the buffer if the call created it.
@item @code{synthesize_speech} @tab audio @tab irreversible @tab spoken audio cannot be taken back
@item @code{vidstudio_add_audio} @tab vidstudio @tab irreversible @tab the vidstudio project model has no undo
